Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It works!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.07,0:00:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Cold weather's not going to stop Vick!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.86,0:00:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Briar, I'm literally starving here! \NWhere are those fish you promised me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.98,0:00:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Under the snow and ice, I bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Briar!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:00:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Briar?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:01:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I found our fishing spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bramble, find a way to break the ice \Nso we can get the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.63,0:01:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure fish are down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.11,0:01:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Right here. Now get going, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.13,0:01:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.55,0:01:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, keep going at it. The fish are right underneath you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.73,0:01:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bramble!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That was scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.82,0:01:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know how to swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.74,0:01:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.34,0:01:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They look delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.42,0:01:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta have one!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:01:56.82,Default,,0,0,950,,Alright, job well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:01:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to chow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I got one! I got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.72,0:02:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.51,0:02:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it! We got it, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get back here. That's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Vick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.98,0:02:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my log!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.98,0:02:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my head hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Briar, did you catch the fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Logger Vick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.12,0:02:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it always those two dumb bears?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vicky, you just cost me a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.98,0:03:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You owe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.14,0:03:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.17,0:03:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Show them what you're made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, Fluffer Teddy Bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.62,0:03:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Bramble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.49,0:03:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see you try and do that again, Mr. Vick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got, then? Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for double speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.39,0:03:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.57,0:04:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this all I got left?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bramble, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.35,0:04:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.47,0:04:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Close, but no cigar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.23,0:04:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't get us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bag you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You look just like Elmer Fudd!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my hat at?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop mocking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.93,0:04:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the little Vicky doesn't know how to skate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you! I'm a natural!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him, Bramble. He can't even stand up straight on the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You! Two stinking bears!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.35,0:05:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta get you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.60,0:06:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vicky, can I borrow that hat for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, give me back my hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm Vicky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.37,0:06:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bramble, check this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.79,0:06:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah. You want this? Come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh. Ah! I hate you, bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that? I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vicky, why don't you come get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.15,0:06:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ugly Logger Vick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I've got some new kicks,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give you bears the boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you two bears, go ahead and laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.26,0:07:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I get my hands on you two, \NI'm gonna turn you into bear patties.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and get me, Vicky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.94,0:07:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop skating away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.43,0:07:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.85,0:07:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's better. Dark or light meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bramble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back, you dumb tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.37,0:07:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope he never pulls it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.41,0:07:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A Tutu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those bears doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.09,0:08:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, quit being a pest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So you both think you're figure skaters now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.24,0:08:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bramble, come on, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Neener, neener!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.81,0:08:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, time to see what this baby can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.91,0:09:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.67,0:09:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, step back, I'm trained in CPR.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.53,0:09:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's like a fish dispenser.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:09:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, Briar! That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.37,0:10:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's use him to catch fish every time!
